'''''Pla dels Horts, Cumará, Estret''''' is a municipality in the [[Cumará (comarca)|Cumará comarca]], [[Estret Province]], [[Balboa]]. With a population of 44,530 in 2026, it is a semi-rural suburban district in the western part of the comarca, characterised by scattered settlements and small-scale agricultural land. The municipality's name ({{lang|ca|pla dels horts}}, "plain of the orchards") reflects the fruit orchards that historically occupied the area.

== Geography ==

Pla dels Horts occupies a gently sloping plain between the coastal strip of [[Costa Serena]] and the inland agricultural lands of central Cumará. The terrain is predominantly flat, with elevations ranging from 40 to 90 metres. Small streams drain westward across the plain toward the Shendan coast. The soil is fertile alluvial loam, suitable for fruit cultivation and mixed agriculture.

=== Climate ===

Pla dels Horts has a {{w|tropical monsoon climate}} ({{w|Köppen climate classification|Köppen}} Am), with average daily highs of 30 to 32 °C and lows of 22 to 24 °C. Annual precipitation averages approximately 2,200 to 2,500 mm, with the wet season from May to November.

== Demographics ==

Pla dels Horts's population of 44,530 is dispersed across scattered settlements and small residential clusters. The population is predominantly [[Black Balboan people|Black Balboan]] and mixed Balboan, with a small [[Fosian Balboan|Fosian]] community. The municipality's low density and semi-rural character have limited population growth compared to the denser commuter municipalities along the rail corridor.

== Economy ==

The economy of Pla dels Horts combines small-scale agriculture with residential services. The plain supports fruit orchards, vegetable cultivation, and maize farming, though agricultural output is modest. Some residents commute to [[Costa Serena]] or [[Sant Cristòfor]] for employment, using the CristoCarril Line A station at Costa Serena.

== Transport ==

[[CristoCarril]] [[Line A (CristoCarril)|Line A]] serves Pla dels Horts via the [[Pla dels Horts (CristoCarril)|Pla dels Horts station]], providing a commuter rail connection northward to [[Sant Cristòfor Central Terminal|Sant Cristòfor Central]] along the Coastal Line. The [[E68 expressway (Balboa)|E68 expressway]] connects the municipality eastward to the [[E5 expressway (Balboa)|E5 expressway]] corridor at [[Brises, Estret|Brises]].

